  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s3.w15.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "main.s3.w15.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s3.w15.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "clearSprites"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s3.w15.node.direction.mimi.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s3.w15.asset.sprite.mimi.smile",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w15.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w15.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "朝から、太い雨。掲示板に「本日、全興行休止」三年目の体は、傘より先に、あの店へ向かう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w15.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w15.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "閉店後のカジノカフェ、窓際の定席。今日も、そこへ。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w15.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w15.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "今日の用は、無い。雨の日は、無いのが用らしい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w15.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w15.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "定席で名簿を広げ、集まった名前をただ眺める。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w15.node.line.002c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w15.line.002c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "仲居さん、番台のおじいさん、山の湯の笛吹きの湯守さん。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w15.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w15.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "窓の外を、傘が流れていく。去年の雨の日を、思い出した。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w15.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w15.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "この席で、なぜ私は覚えているのだろうと、湯気に問うた日だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w15.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w15.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "あのときは、答えを雨の音に流した。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w15.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w15.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "今年は、答えを持っている。私が覚えているのは、空から来た口だから。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w15.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w15.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "うちの面々が覚えているのは、物語を生き切った人たちだから。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w15.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w15.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "同じ「覚えている」でも、通ってきた道が違う。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w15.node.line.004d",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w15.line.004d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……別々の道から、この店の同じ席に来たんだ。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w15.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w15.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "試しに、隣で茶を飲む仲間に聞いてみた。「巻き戻る朝って、怖くないですか」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w15.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w15.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「怖くないですよ。覚えてるもん、こっちは」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w15.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w15.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……強い。この強さに、三年間、ずっと守られてきたと思う。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w15.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w15.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "逆に、聞かれた。「ミミさんは、怖くないんですか」少し考えて、正直に答える。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w15.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w15.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「前は、変だなあ、だけでした」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w15.node.line.006c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w15.line.006c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「今年は——取り返す途中なので、忙しくて、怖がる暇がないです」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w15.node.line.006d",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w15.line.006d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……笑われて、耳の先だけ熱くなった。それでいい。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w15.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w15.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "雨が上がる前に、名簿の頁を数えた。まだ、道半ば。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w15.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w15.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "裁きの日までの暦を、指で折る。大会、湯、大会、湯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w15.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w15.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……予定表が、去年より楽しそうなのは、なぜだろう。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w15.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w15.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "店を出るとき、雨あがりの空を、つい見上げた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w15.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w15.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "雨の日に、空を見る癖——あの覚え書き、当たっているのかも。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s3.w15.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s3.w15.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
